    "changes": [
      "OSVersion is a downstream struct instead of Rust u32/NonZero; parser helpers are not identical.",
      "libc calls become local extern declarations, crate::mem becomes core::mem, and path conversion uses CString/OsStringExt.",
      "Later downstream changes replace c-string literals with nul-terminated byte slices and target_abi checks with compatibility cfgs; assertion formatting also differs.",
      "The declaration/comments and CoreFoundation plist extraction, Deferred, cache and sysctl logic retain long matching blocks. The files as a whole are not byte-identical."
    ]
